1: """The report as one self-contained HTML page (#1419).
2: 
3: The page reads well in a browser, on a phone and in print. It loads nothing and
4: runs nothing: styles are inline, there is no script, and a Content-Security-Policy
5: forbids any fetch. Report text is rendered as CommonMark with raw HTML and images
6: off, so nothing a model wrote can inject markup or load a remote asset.
7: """
8: 
9: from datetime import datetime
